    "description": "A product media gallery. Renders a large feature image plus a strip of thumbnails synthesized from config.images[], positioned by config.layout (\"bottom\" | \"top\" | \"left\" | \"right\" | \"single\" | \"grid\" | \"grid-2\" — \"single\" hides the thumbnail strip, \"grid\"/\"grid-2\" lay out every image as equal cells instead of a feature+strip split). Clicking a thumbnail swaps the feature image on published pages. Pin which product feeds it via config.productId; once pinned (or placed under a product page) it binds to that product's live image + gallery, falling back to the seeded config.images when unbound. Owns no children.",
